57
00:04:43,493 --> 00:04:45,012
<font color=#FFFF00>Es el nombre de mi abuela.</font>

58
00:04:45,012 --> 00:04:47,130
<font color=#FFFF00>Y no tolero a tu
abuela, John.</font>

59
00:04:47,170 --> 00:04:48,449
<font color=#FFFF00>Oh cielos.</font>

60
00:04:48,449 --> 00:04:51,167
